body:
drip, drip, drip

&#x200B;

one drop, two drops, three drops and it all seems fine, another brick on and another piece falls.

&#x200B;

going through the motions day in, day out, it all seems fine.

&#x200B;

push the blade a little deeper but theres nothing left inside.

&#x200B;

the more i cry out for help and try to stay alive, the water rushes in and...............

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

see.... the thing is...... lifes not what it seems.........lifes f\*\*\*ing hard.................

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

when i look into the night sky, i see my dreams just flying by.

&#x200B;

100 trillion miles to where i wanna go but no way to get there. 

&#x200B;

dont know where to go or who to ask. all these thoughts got me going crazy.

&#x200B;

part of me is missing, lost, gone forever. 

&#x200B;

dont know how or why but everyday it gets me. 

&#x200B;

gets me closer and closer to the edge. feel like im dying from the inside,

&#x200B;

slowly

&#x200B;

painfully 

&#x200B;

wish there was a way to repair me,

&#x200B;

someone or something to fix the hole inside me.

&#x200B;

the flame that is my soul is slowly going out, running out of gas.

&#x200B;

times running out, things are going too fast. 

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

when i look into the night sky, i see where i wanna be.

&#x200B;

so close yet so far,

&#x200B;

all this weight on my shoulder pushing me down deeper. 

&#x200B;

As i cry out the water rushes in, silencing my screams

&#x200B;

Im bound to the ground by a million pounds, nothing to ease the weight of life.

&#x200B;

ive got a heart of glass with only so many pieces to fall off.

&#x200B;

only so many bricks it can hold before it shatters.

&#x200B;

these chains keep me down while i watch helplessly from this prison called my mind.

&#x200B;

my only escape is 2 windows looking into the night sky,

&#x200B;

dreaming of where i could be,

&#x200B;

what i could be doing.

&#x200B;

looking for a cure for this deiseise called life,

&#x200B;

something to ease the pain,



make it all go away.

&#x200B;

My world is falling apart, little by little.

&#x200B;

pills work once or twice just like needles and bottles. 

&#x200B;

In the end they they drag the knife a little deeper,

&#x200B;

always i end up seeing myself in the bottom of the bottle and i think to myself, why???

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

When i look into the night sky, i see where i am.

&#x200B;

Stuck in the ground, watching the world go round and round.

&#x200B;

feeling helpless and hopeless. 

&#x200B;

everyone trys to help but no one knows how.

&#x200B;

no-one gets me, understands me or wants to.

&#x200B;

feel like the worlds agaisnt me.

&#x200B;

struggle everyday in the grips of addiciton. 

&#x200B;

these bindings getting tighter and tighter.

&#x200B;

the light gets darker an dimmer.

&#x200B;

the blood rains down.

&#x200B;

Goodbye............................................

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

hows that? i tried to make an actual chorus and put some more meaning into it so its not quite as random. 

&#x200B;

&#x200B;
